  "_controls_why": "The 20 golden variants all sit in colorectal driver genes, so they never exercise the gene_not_a_driver_in_scope state -- the fourth coverage outcome was untested, and the distribution left a constant 'evidence' stub failing exactly 10/20 rather than a majority. These d-prefixed controls are real ClinVar missense variants in the five grant genes IntOGen has NO colorectal rows for (MLH1, MSH2, MSH6, PMS2, TGFBR2), each cited by accession. They exercise the missing state and rebalance the fixture. The fixture was strengthened rather than the assertion weakened."
